<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Offshore Drilling — Market Cap Snapshot | August 2026</title>

<style>
    :root {
        --bg: #07111f;
        --bg-secondary: #0b1728;
        --card: #101f33;
        --card-hover: #142840;
        --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.09);

        --text: #f4f7fb;
        --muted: #9caec4;

        --blue: #2f9bff;
        --cyan: #31d3e8;
        --green: #2dd881;
        --orange: #ffb020;
        --red: #ff5d5d;

        --gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #2f9bff, #31d3e8);
    }

    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }

    body {
        font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system,
                     BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        background:
            radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, rgba(47,155,255,.12), transparent 30%),
            radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(49,211,232,.08), transparent 25%),
            var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    .container {
        max-width: 1250px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* HEADER */

    .header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-end;
        gap: 30px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
        color: var(--cyan);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 62px);
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: -2px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .subtitle {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 17px;
        max-width: 720px;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .date-badge {
        padding: 12px 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
        border-radius: 12px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 13px;
        white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .date-badge strong {
        color: var(--text);
    }

    /* HERO STATS */

    .hero-stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .stat-card {
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(20,40,64,.95), rgba(10,23,40,.95));
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 24px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .stat-card::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 3px;
        background: var(--gradient);
    }

    .stat-label {
        font-size: 12px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1.4px;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .stat-value {
        font-size: 34px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .stat-note {
        margin-top: 8px;
        color: var(--green);
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* MARKET TABLE */

    .section-card {
        background: rgba(16,31,51,.82);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .section-title {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 21px;
        letter-spacing: -.5px;
    }

    .section-tag {
        color: var(--cyan);
        background: rgba(49,211,232,.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(49,211,232,.18);
        padding: 7px 12px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 800;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .table-wrapper {
        overflow-x: auto;
    }

    table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        min-width: 850px;
    }

    th {
        text-align: left;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 11px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1.2px;
        padding: 0 16px 14px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    td {
        padding: 20px 16px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
        font-size: 15px;
    }

    tr:last-child td {
        border-bottom: none;
    }

    tbody tr {
        transition: .2s ease;
    }

    tbody tr:hover {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
    }

    .company {
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 17px;
    }

    .ticker {
        display: inline-block;
        color: var(--blue);
        font-weight: 800;
    }

    .price {
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .market-cap {
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 800;
    }

    .positive {
        color: var(--green);
        font-weight: 800;
    }

    .recovery {
        color: var(--orange);
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* INSIGHTS */

    .insights-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .insight {
        background: rgba(16,31,51,.82);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 28px;
    }

    .insight-icon {
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: rgba(47,155,255,.12);
        border: 1px solid rgba(47,155,255,.2);
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .insight h3 {
        font-size: 19px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .insight p {
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
        font-size: 14px;
    }

    .highlight {
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* MERGER */

    .merger-card {
        background:
            linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(47,155,255,.13), rgba(49,211,232,.05)),
            var(--card);
        border: 1px solid rgba(47,155,255,.25);
        border-radius: 22px;
        padding: 34px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .merger-card::before {
        content: "RIG + VAL";
        position: absolute;
        right: -10px;
        top: -25px;
        font-size: 100px;
        font-weight: 900;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
        letter-spacing: -8px;
    }

    .merger-content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
    }

    .merger-label {
        color: var(--cyan);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1.8px;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .merger-card h2 {
        font-size: 30px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .merger-card p {
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
        max-width: 850px;
    }

    .merger-number {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 22px;
        padding: 16px 22px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
        border-radius: 14px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .merger-number small {
        display: block;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        font-size: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .merger-number strong {
        font-size: 27px;
        color: var(--cyan);
    }

    /* FOOTER */

    footer {
        text-align: center;
        color: #62738a;
        font-size: 12px;
        margin-top: 30px;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */

    @media (max-width: 850px) {
        .header {
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .hero-stats,
        .insights-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        body {
            padding: 25px 14px;
        }

        .section-card,
        .insight,
        .merger-card {
            padding: 22px;
        }
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <!-- HEADER -->

    <header class="header">

        <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Energy Markets · Offshore Drilling</div>

            <h1>Market Cap Snapshot</h1>

            <p class="subtitle">
                Offshore drilling contractors are experiencing a significant market
                re-rating, driven by elevated day rates, tightening deepwater capacity
                and improving long-term utilization.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="date-badge">
            Snapshot: <strong>August 2026</strong>
        </div>

    </header>


    <!-- HERO STATS -->

    <section class="hero-stats">

        <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-label">Largest Market Cap</div>
            <div class="stat-value">~$7.7B</div>
            <div class="stat-note">Transocean · RIG</div>
        </div>

        <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-label">Strongest YoY Growth</div>
            <div class="stat-value">+137%</div>
            <div class="stat-note">Seadrill · SDRL</div>
        </div>

        <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-label">Potential Combined Value</div>
            <div class="stat-value">$12–14B</div>
            <div class="stat-note">RIG + VAL scenario</div>
        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- MARKET TABLE -->

    <section class="section-card">

        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>Offshore Drilling Market Comparison</h2>
            <span class="section-tag">NYSE Listed</span>
        </div>

        <div class="table-wrapper">

            <table>

                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Company</th>
                        <th>Ticker</th>
                        <th>Price</th>
                        <th>Market Cap</th>
                        <th>52-Week Range</th>
                        <th>YoY Change</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>

                <tbody>

                    <tr>
                        <td class="company">Transocean</td>
                        <td><span class="ticker">NYSE: RIG</span></td>
                        <td class="price">~$5.80–6.91</td>
                        <td class="market-cap">~$6.4–7.7B</td>
                        <td>$2.94–7.66</td>
                        <td class="positive">+115%</td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td class="company">Valaris</td>
                        <td><span class="ticker">NYSE: VAL</span></td>
                        <td class="price">~$98.09</td>
                        <td class="market-cap">~$5.46–6.9B</td>
                        <td>—</td>
                        <td class="recovery">Significant recovery</td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td class="company">Seadrill</td>
                        <td><span class="ticker">NYSE: SDRL</span></td>
                        <td class="price">~$42.58</td>
                        <td class="market-cap">~$3.0–3.1B</td>
                        <td>$27.40–55.47</td>
                        <td class="positive">+137%</td>
                    </tr>

                </tbody>

            </table>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- KEY CONTEXT -->

    <section class="insights-grid">

        <article class="insight">

            <div class="insight-icon">⚓</div>

            <h3>Transocean: Deepwater Momentum</h3>

            <p>
                Transocean's Q2 2026 revenue reached
                <span class="highlight">$966M</span>, slightly above the
                <span class="highlight">$962.88M consensus</span>.
            </p>

            <br>

            <p>
                The strategic backdrop remains increasingly favorable, with
                deepwater rig utilization expected to approach
                <span class="highlight">100% by 2027</span>.
            </p>

        </article>


        <article class="insight">

            <div class="insight-icon">📈</div>

            <h3>Seadrill: Earnings Recovery</h3>

            <p>
                Seadrill posted Q1 2026 EPS of
                <span class="highlight">−$0.11</span>, outperforming the
                <span class="highlight">−$0.28 forecast</span>.
            </p>

            <br>

            <p>
                Revenue reached <span class="highlight">$358M</span>, supporting
                an increase in full-year 2026 operating revenue guidance to
                <span class="highlight">$1.43B–$1.48B</span>.
            </p>

        </article>

    </section>


    <!-- MARKET RE-RATING -->

    <section class="section-card">

        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>The Offshore Drilling Re-Rating</h2>
            <span class="section-tag">Sector Tailwind</span>
        </div>

        <p style="color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; max-width: 1000px;">
            Offshore drilling equities have experienced a substantial market re-rating.
            Transocean's market capitalization increased approximately
            <strong style="color: var(--green);">115.61%</strong> over the past
            12 months, while Seadrill increased approximately
            <strong style="color: var(--green);">137.49%</strong>.
            The move reflects a combination of elevated day rates, tightening offshore
            capacity, improving contract visibility and an energy-sector geopolitical
            premium.
        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- MERGER -->

    <section class="merger-card">

        <div class="merger-content">

            <div class="merger-label">
                Major Structural Development
            </div>

            <h2>The Transocean + Valaris Merger</h2>

            <p>
                The proposed combination of Transocean and Valaris represents the
                most significant structural development in the offshore drilling
                industry. If completed, the combined company would become the
                <strong style="color: var(--text);">
                    largest offshore drilling contractor in the world by fleet size
                </strong>.
            </p>

            <div class="merger-number">
                <small>Potential Combined Market Capitalization</small>
                <strong>$12–14 Billion</strong>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <footer>
        Offshore Drilling — Market Cap Snapshot · August 2026<br>
        Market figures are approximate and reflect the snapshot data provided.
    </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
